settle 20
act Open Inspector pane
settle 5
act Search saved sources
type example
key escape
act Close pane
open file:///m5/run/fixture-source/episode.mp3
settle 60
assert pane turnstone.redshank-episode
capture 01_episode_visible
click surface:contributed role:button Add text note
settle 20
capture 02_note_editor
click surface:contributed role:textbox
insert M5 authored Redshank note
click surface:contributed role:button Save text note
settle 60
capture 03_saved_note
assert text M5 authored Redshank note
act Fit to view
settle 10
click-note-member
assert-no-action Retain selected Redshank note
capture 04_private_member
click-at 700 130
act Maximize pane
settle 10
click surface:contributed role:button More actions for note at 0:00
settle 8
click surface:contributed role:button Make shareable: note at 0:00
settle 20
capture 05_shareable_note
act Maximize pane
settle 10
act Fit to view
settle 10
click-note-member
assert snap actions ~ Retain selected Redshank note
act Retain selected Redshank note
settle 60
act Search saved sources
type M5 authored Redshank note
wait-research-search 600
assert snap suggestions ~ Note:
record-saved-sources 06_note_research
capture 06_note_research
assert event m5-intentional-diagnostic-stop
